gnupg2            Armbian debootstrap list: transitional package for gnupg
gpiod             Armbian minimal list on some releases: GPIO command-line tools
libgpiod2t64      dependency of gpiod

# Required by the board support package's Depends line
fping             BSP Depends (kept so the BSP package installs; nothing in Roxora runs it)

